WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:04.820
Can you track them, Gwiber?

00:04.820 --> 00:05.720
Yes.

00:06.140 --> 00:10.560
However, humans have a faint presence
and will take longer to locate.

00:11.360 --> 00:14.260
That's pathetic,
White Dragon Gwiber.

00:15.840 --> 00:18.560
Leave it to me.

00:18.560 --> 00:20.700
S-Surely you aren't...

00:20.860 --> 00:22.600
Lord Bennu the Phoenix!?

00:22.600 --> 00:24.520
Sup, how ya been?

00:24.520 --> 00:27.080
I thought you retired!?

00:27.080 --> 00:31.370
Stuff happened and the girlie
you're looking for is now my master.

00:31.370 --> 00:34.190
A sacred beast
and its master share a soul.

00:34.190 --> 00:37.420
I'll always know where she is
no matter where she goes.

00:37.420 --> 00:41.060
Sariphi's sacred beast.
What does it say?

00:41.200 --> 00:47.080
I'm saying I'll help this sorry king who let
his girl be taken from under his nose.

00:47.080 --> 00:49.760
You better appreciate it,
ya dang fool.

00:49.760 --> 00:55.540
H-He will find the human princess
for Your Majesty's sake.

00:55.540 --> 00:56.700
I see.

00:57.400 --> 00:59.660
That's a very mild way of putting it.

01:00.040 --> 01:02.400
You have my gratitude,
Phoenix Bennu.

01:02.820 --> 01:07.420
This isn't for you.
I'm just doing whatever I like.

01:07.800 --> 01:12.300
Not much point in contracting
again without the girlie around.

01:12.300 --> 01:14.500
Oh, keep heading north
in this direction.

01:16.420 --> 01:19.100
Forgive me, Sariphi.

01:19.100 --> 01:25.220
Even should your happiness lies
with that man, I...

01:26.720 --> 01:29.660
can no longer bear
not having you with me.

01:34.700 --> 01:39.900
(Sacrificial Princess and the King of Beasts)

03:00.940 --> 03:05.940
(The Boy Lost in Love and Hatred)

03:10.140 --> 03:12.500
We're quite a distance away
from the palace.

03:13.140 --> 03:14.900
Are these ruins?

03:14.900 --> 03:16.080
Huh?

03:18.160 --> 03:23.420
We came to check out which fools had
the guts to waltz into hyenafolk territory.

03:23.840 --> 03:27.800
The heck is going on?
I smell humans.

03:27.800 --> 03:29.900
That's not all.

03:29.900 --> 03:31.060
He's got a bitch!

03:31.060 --> 03:32.940
Don't see those often.

03:33.500 --> 03:39.440
Since the armistice, us riff-raff don't
come across humans much.

03:39.440 --> 03:42.720
We're a kind bunch.
You get to live, dog.

03:42.720 --> 03:48.120
All you have to do is leave the bitch.
We'll savour her down to the last bone.

03:57.080 --> 03:58.300
Ilya!

04:01.560 --> 04:05.130
Shit, this dog's strong!
Fall back, fall back!

04:05.130 --> 04:06.180
Daddy!

04:12.060 --> 04:13.900
S-Stop, human!

04:13.900 --> 04:15.500
Don't kill my daddy!

04:23.500 --> 04:25.120
Quick, run away!

04:31.140 --> 04:32.780
Why, Ilya?

04:32.780 --> 04:35.010
How could you try to kill a child?

04:35.280 --> 04:39.220
Even a kid will one day
grow up to kill humans.

04:39.620 --> 04:41.620
That's just
what these creatures are.

04:43.320 --> 04:44.700
But Ilya...

04:45.420 --> 04:50.460
You wanted to drive away bad demonkind
who cross the border to attack villages.

04:51.380 --> 04:55.400
You said you wanted to become strong
to protect weaker humans.

04:56.380 --> 04:59.300
That's the Ilya I remember.

05:00.180 --> 05:05.860
I did. But it's plain as day to me now
that it's not enough to protect a damn thing.

05:06.280 --> 05:10.240
Sariphi, the demons
must have you under their spell.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.240
In order to wake you up,

05:12.980 --> 05:17.040
I'll willingly slaughter
every single one of them.

05:17.040 --> 05:17.980
Why?

05:18.720 --> 05:21.420
Why would you go that far for me?

05:24.320 --> 05:25.400
Ilya...

05:33.760 --> 05:35.760
Ilya, what are you...

05:36.740 --> 05:37.860
It's...

05:38.810 --> 05:41.700
It's because I'm in love
with you, Sariphi.

05:42.460 --> 05:44.060
I always have been!

05:46.560 --> 05:48.000
Where are you, Sariphi?

05:48.500 --> 05:52.540
Once they cross the border to Yoana,
finding them will be impossible.

05:52.550 --> 05:54.720
Calm down, will ya?

05:54.720 --> 05:58.050
For a big dude
you sure are one fidgety kitty.

05:58.600 --> 06:02.420
A king's gotta always be
a haughty cool cucumber.

06:03.040 --> 06:04.890
What did it say, Gwiber?

06:05.140 --> 06:09.150
He is giving his all
towards tracking the human.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.460
Tough job you have there.

06:11.460 --> 06:15.220
Mind your words if you'd like
to make things easier for me.

06:15.420 --> 06:17.100
Yeah, yeah.

06:17.100 --> 06:21.060
Gotta say though,
they're moving awfully fast for humans.

06:21.060 --> 06:23.400
Did they find
a horse or something?

06:23.940 --> 06:27.020
Might be an idea
to pick up the pace.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.120
Ilya.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.720
I'm sorry.

06:34.720 --> 06:38.540
Right now, I can't
accept your feelings.

06:40.180 --> 06:43.220
What you're looking at isn't me.

06:43.580 --> 06:46.260
Only your unbridled hatred.

06:47.180 --> 06:48.380
It's terrifying.

06:49.480 --> 06:50.960
And so saddening.

06:59.100 --> 07:02.940
I can't blame you for hating the demonkind
who attacked your hometown.

07:03.700 --> 07:09.460
Humans and demonkind could be
clashing somewhere right now.

07:09.460 --> 07:12.560
There might be
people suffering from it.

07:13.500 --> 07:14.200
Even so,

07:15.080 --> 07:18.520
not all of demonkind seek
to fight humans.

07:18.520 --> 07:22.960
Some of them are kind, some are timid,
there are all sorts of people.

07:23.660 --> 07:25.440
Just like humans.

07:26.460 --> 07:32.340
A world without conflict between
humans and demonkind may not be realistic.

07:33.060 --> 07:37.120
Despite that, His Majesty hopes to be
even the tiniest bit closer to that world.

07:37.700 --> 07:41.180
Beneath that powerful and fearsome
exterior lies a kind heart

07:41.180 --> 07:43.870
who protects
both demonkind and humans.

07:45.300 --> 07:51.560
It's because he's like this that
I want to do whatever I can for him.

07:52.540 --> 07:58.680
Even if your hatred for them stays,
I want you to have some trust.

07:58.680 --> 08:01.590
Have faith that my belief
in him is true.

08:04.300 --> 08:06.440
Demonkind and humans, the same?

08:07.040 --> 08:11.180
You can spew that drivel
because you don't know a thing.

08:12.000 --> 08:15.600
Sure, humans have their
share of worthless shitheads.

08:16.160 --> 08:19.620
But you see, demons are
fundamentally different.

08:20.280 --> 08:24.120
It's like when kids innocently tear
bugs apart for fun

08:24.120 --> 08:27.040
or how we have no issue
eating animal meat or fish.

08:28.020 --> 08:32.160
Have you ever imagined
what it's like to be preyed on?

08:32.880 --> 08:37.380
That's how everything that
mattered to me was taken away.

08:38.040 --> 08:40.300
On that day, 13 years ago...

08:40.960 --> 08:43.340
Crud, it's Ilya. Run for it!

08:43.340 --> 08:44.420
Ow!

08:44.640 --> 08:48.720
You'll get more than that
the next time you make my sister cry!

08:49.580 --> 08:52.920
You alright, Misha?
What'd they say to you?

08:53.480 --> 09:00.860
They said that my hair's different from Mummy
and you because I'll be given away.

09:00.860 --> 09:05.410
That the demon country is
coming for me!

09:05.620 --> 09:11.160
That's just bull. You're
a redhead like our late Dad.

09:11.160 --> 09:17.180
Even if demons do come for you,
I'll keep you safe. I promise.

09:17.180 --> 09:18.860
Don't you worry, Misha.

09:20.060 --> 09:22.560
Okay! That's a promise.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.890
No breaking it!

09:25.240 --> 09:27.080
Mummy's late.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.960
When are we getting snacks?

09:29.640 --> 09:31.260
Ilya! Misha!

09:31.260 --> 09:32.620
Come here!

09:32.940 --> 09:34.840
Are we playing hide-and-seek?

09:34.840 --> 09:37.440
Be quiet and stay put.

09:37.440 --> 09:39.380
Don't ever make a sound, okay?

09:39.900 --> 09:42.880
Listen, Ilya.
Please take care of Misha.

09:54.560 --> 09:57.320
What's that!?
What's going on out there?

10:02.700 --> 10:03.600
Look.

10:03.600 --> 10:05.260
- Demons!
- I thought I smelled something.

10:05.260 --> 10:09.700
- Ilya, I'm so scared!
- So she was hiding her kids.

10:09.940 --> 10:11.300
Does that mean Mum's...

10:11.300 --> 10:13.680
Just what we need for dessert.

10:16.900 --> 10:18.340
Misha!

10:18.400 --> 10:20.120
Stop, let her go!

10:20.120 --> 10:20.840
Ilya!

10:27.960 --> 10:29.340
What about this one?

10:29.680 --> 10:32.320
Young males still taste like crap.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.340
I got it.

10:33.340 --> 10:36.920
Let's bet how far
he can run from us.

10:36.920 --> 10:42.920
Nice one. I get half of the female
you caught earlier if I win.

10:42.920 --> 10:44.820
Alright kid, get up!

10:44.820 --> 10:46.360
Go on.

10:46.800 --> 10:48.280
Get running.

10:59.920 --> 11:01.900
That's it, keep going!

11:01.900 --> 11:03.620
We're gonna getcha!

11:04.120 --> 11:09.060
I had my family, hometown
and dignity taken.

11:09.060 --> 11:13.920
Had I not ran into my master,
I'd have died a dog's death.

11:14.860 --> 11:18.580
After all that, what appeared
before my desolate self...

11:19.100 --> 11:20.940
was a new ray of hope.

11:22.640 --> 11:25.480
Yet those cretins snatched
it away again.

11:26.180 --> 11:28.160
I should've realised this sooner.

11:28.900 --> 11:34.620
That we'll never have peace
for as long as demonkind exists.

11:35.300 --> 11:38.850
The answer is to kill.
Be it a child or king,

11:38.850 --> 11:42.800
I'll murder them all.
I gained strength for this very reason!

11:43.400 --> 11:44.840
Ilya...

11:45.600 --> 11:51.140
His hatred and sadness run
much deeper than I ever imagined.

11:51.580 --> 11:53.220
There's no stopping it.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.720
Not by me...

11:57.920 --> 11:59.690
We spent too much time talking.

11:59.980 --> 12:01.620
Fine by me though.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.700
Ilya?

12:06.040 --> 12:06.660
Ouch!

12:07.120 --> 12:09.140
Watch me.

12:09.140 --> 12:10.240
Ilya!

12:19.200 --> 12:22.370
I'll free you from their spell.

12:28.960 --> 12:29.940
Your Majesty...

12:31.120 --> 12:34.000
I hope for your sake
that you have not been rough with her.

12:34.640 --> 12:37.140
You will return my queen.

12:37.880 --> 12:41.640
Get your head fixed.
Sariphi's human.

12:41.640 --> 12:44.580
I'm making you return her to me.

12:44.840 --> 12:48.660
Come at me if you want her back.

12:48.860 --> 12:52.260
Take her by force if you seek her.

13:00.060 --> 13:00.900
Ilya!

13:00.900 --> 13:02.010
Don't do this, Ilya!

13:02.010 --> 13:02.850
Ilya!

13:02.940 --> 13:04.700
Still kickin', huh?

13:05.320 --> 13:06.520
Benny!

13:06.520 --> 13:07.300
Heya.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.680
Please, untie me!

13:09.680 --> 13:12.680
Then what? You thinking
of stopping them?

13:12.680 --> 13:15.050
Forget it, that's just dumb.

13:15.160 --> 13:19.680
Sometimes men hafta work
out their problems with their fists.

13:19.680 --> 13:21.880
Ilya will be in danger.

13:21.880 --> 13:25.660
Well, duh. He's up
against the king of demonkind.

13:25.660 --> 13:28.290
A single human's got no chance.

13:28.290 --> 13:31.780
I'm sure that brat knows
that better than anyone else.

13:32.480 --> 13:33.940
Yet...

13:40.680 --> 13:44.250
He's not all brawns.
Nothing slips past his watch.

13:44.520 --> 13:46.160
I'm no match for him.

13:46.540 --> 13:47.770
Even so...

13:48.080 --> 13:49.170
I won't back off!

13:49.800 --> 13:52.880
That day will repeat itself if I run.

13:53.560 --> 13:56.040
I'll have nothing...

13:56.040 --> 13:57.180
Nothing!

14:02.020 --> 14:03.180
I only have this second!

14:03.660 --> 14:04.340
You're dea...

14:19.440 --> 14:20.380
Hah...

14:20.900 --> 14:25.050
Is that all...
the demon lord has?

14:25.340 --> 14:28.810
This kiddy play isn't
enough to stop me.

14:29.120 --> 14:33.140
Rip me to shreds with those claws,
tear me apart with your fangs!

14:33.140 --> 14:34.800
Have your best shot at killing me!

14:35.840 --> 14:37.020
Let's see it.

14:37.540 --> 14:43.020
All the cheap talk in the world can't
hide your hideous, cruel, monstrous ways.

14:43.020 --> 14:44.560
Show it to Sariphi!

14:45.200 --> 14:49.160
If that's what it takes
to open your eyes, I'll...

14:49.160 --> 14:51.360
be more than happy
to be killed here!

15:01.680 --> 15:03.330
Why...?

15:03.740 --> 15:08.400
Hurting you will sadden Sariphi.
That's all there is to it.

15:10.940 --> 15:12.830
But I cannot give up either.

15:13.540 --> 15:14.860
To me...

15:15.300 --> 15:17.600
Sariphi is someone I need.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.640
Your Majesty!

15:24.640 --> 15:27.140
Your Majesty!
Stay strong, please!

15:27.320 --> 15:29.140
Please, say something!

15:29.140 --> 15:29.720
No!

15:29.720 --> 15:30.590
Sariphi...

15:30.590 --> 15:31.580
You can't die!

15:32.480 --> 15:33.460
Who did that?

15:34.560 --> 15:36.780
Who upset you?

15:37.380 --> 15:41.290
Make sure you tell me
if anyone upsets you, okay?

15:41.520 --> 15:44.660
I don't care who it is,
I'll fend them off!

15:49.780 --> 15:54.740
Relax. Demonkind are
far sturdier than humans.

15:55.300 --> 15:58.340
This won't kill me.
More importantly...

16:03.940 --> 16:05.320
What is all this?

16:06.840 --> 16:11.950
Everything I've done
up to this point...

16:13.300 --> 16:17.100
What have I been doing
this whole time?

16:23.000 --> 16:25.490
Ilya, I'm sorry.

16:25.900 --> 16:30.530
Ever since I was young,
I accepted my fate as a sacrifice.

16:30.880 --> 16:34.800
Which was why I never felt that
I needed friends or memories.

16:35.420 --> 16:38.140
But now I finally realise it.

16:39.160 --> 16:44.260
That the reason I've been able
to spend my days leading to it in peace

16:45.100 --> 16:48.300
was because you were
there for me, Ilya.

16:49.600 --> 16:52.380
You've been saving me
since the day we met.

16:52.560 --> 16:53.300
So...

16:53.820 --> 16:57.240
Please... forgive yourself.

16:57.740 --> 17:03.000
Don't think that you couldn't save
a thing. Don't put it all on yourself.

17:04.060 --> 17:05.140
Ilya...

17:08.060 --> 17:11.660
Thank you for protecting me.

17:23.660 --> 17:25.940
Looks like the sun's finally up.

17:34.500 --> 17:36.500
That oughta patch you up.

17:36.500 --> 17:39.620
Not like you really needed it.

17:39.620 --> 17:41.450
Thank you, Benny!

17:41.680 --> 17:44.540
Your wish,
my command and all that.

17:44.780 --> 17:45.820
However...

17:45.820 --> 17:50.600
You've got a lotta nerve asking
the great phoenix to give a human a lift.

17:52.740 --> 17:56.850
Don't bother.
I'm not relying on demons.

17:57.040 --> 17:58.560
Who's a demon!?

17:58.560 --> 18:00.580
I'm a sacred beast
that has far outlived you,

18:00.580 --> 18:02.580
the great phoenix!
You hear me, fool!?

18:03.060 --> 18:07.120
I have barred you from the country
for what may as well be eternity.

18:07.120 --> 18:09.760
Sariphi must want
to see you off one last time.

18:10.460 --> 18:12.060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:12.500 --> 18:13.860
Are you really okay with this?

18:14.740 --> 18:15.600
Yes.

18:16.920 --> 18:18.860
Aren't you confident?

18:19.380 --> 18:23.840
Just so we're clear, I have no intention
of sticking to your damn rules.

18:23.840 --> 18:26.330
What'll you do
if I take her again?

18:26.580 --> 18:29.660
You will do
no such thing anymore.

18:29.660 --> 18:31.540
As Sariphi believes this,

18:32.020 --> 18:34.320
I shall choose to do the same.

18:36.540 --> 18:40.370
Your head's way up in the clouds.
Some demon lord you are.

18:40.640 --> 18:44.610
That moniker was foisted
upon me by your kind.

18:44.740 --> 18:48.060
No such title exists
in this country.

18:48.500 --> 18:53.760
My name is Leonhart.
It stands for one who is brave of heart.

18:55.300 --> 18:57.610
Gave yourself a grand name, huh.

18:57.800 --> 18:58.620
Listen up.

18:59.520 --> 19:03.100
If you ever make Sariphi cry
in the future,

19:04.180 --> 19:06.760
that's when you'll be giving her up.

19:07.440 --> 19:10.420
Don't you forget that, Leonhart.

19:16.020 --> 19:18.830
You have my word.

19:21.060 --> 19:23.880
Hey fella, the border's in sight.

19:23.880 --> 19:27.920
Past that forest is Yoana,
the human country.

19:28.560 --> 19:31.100
We're almost at the border, Ilya!

19:31.100 --> 19:32.080
Ilya?

19:32.840 --> 19:34.540
Are you not good with heights?

19:34.550 --> 19:37.600
Sh-Sh-Shut it,
don't talk to me now!

19:37.960 --> 19:40.060
You don't have to act tough.

19:40.940 --> 19:44.320
I see. Since we last met,

19:44.820 --> 19:49.440
you've learnt how
to smile with joy, Sariphi...

19:50.660 --> 19:54.050
Sorry for selfishly doing
all those things.

19:54.260 --> 19:58.760
It's okay. I'm sorry for keeping quiet
about being a sacrifice.

19:59.600 --> 20:04.730
I never realised
how much you cared for me.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.360
Of course I would.

20:06.360 --> 20:09.680
You were right that
I wasn't looking at you,

20:10.040 --> 20:12.720
but at the demons
I loathe so much.

20:13.380 --> 20:17.600
I won't forgive them and will continue
detesting their existence.

20:18.100 --> 20:18.920
But...

20:19.780 --> 20:23.600
I'll have faith that
your belief in him is true.

20:29.780 --> 20:33.600
I meant it when I said I love you.

20:36.440 --> 20:39.520
Thank you, Ilya!
We'll meet again someday!

20:41.500 --> 20:45.090
Yeah, if it's for you...

20:45.880 --> 20:48.140
I'll come running
to wherever you may be.

20:49.940 --> 20:53.980
I'm really sorry for all the trouble
I caused, Your Majesty.

20:54.360 --> 20:56.860
There's no need
for you to apologise.

20:57.100 --> 20:59.640
I owe you an apology instead.

21:00.180 --> 21:03.280
For a moment, I hesitated
to chase after you.

21:04.560 --> 21:06.740
I had a loss of confidence.

21:06.740 --> 21:11.820
I pondered if you would be happier living
with that man in Yoana,

21:12.700 --> 21:17.500
and that perhaps you willingly chose
to depart with him.

21:19.640 --> 21:24.840
My home isn't in the country
of humans or demonkind.

21:24.840 --> 21:27.260
It's right here, Your Majesty.

21:28.280 --> 21:30.680
Thank you, Leo.

21:32.140 --> 21:33.390
Sariphi!

21:33.390 --> 21:36.570
Forgive our incompetence!

21:36.570 --> 21:38.690
How pleased I am
to see you safe.

21:38.960 --> 21:43.140
Everyone. I'm sorry
for making you all worry.

21:43.140 --> 21:44.020
I know!

21:44.240 --> 21:46.500
Let us celebrate with a tea party!

21:51.140 --> 21:56.020
Demonkind will continue to hate
humans despite His Majesty's efforts.

21:56.020 --> 21:59.060
Like Ilya, there are humans
who hate demonkind too.

21:59.720 --> 22:01.540
They'll never see eye to eye.

22:03.040 --> 22:05.120
Is this just the way things are?

22:05.640 --> 22:09.100
Lady Sariphi, tea has been served.

22:09.200 --> 22:11.300
Wow, a garden party!

22:11.560 --> 22:14.460
It is nice to have it
outdoors on occasion.

22:14.460 --> 22:15.530
Please, have a seat.

22:15.740 --> 22:18.120
Say, where's Cykie and Loppy?

22:18.120 --> 22:20.980
There seems to be more chairs too.

22:21.240 --> 22:23.180
Th-Th-This way, please.

22:26.420 --> 22:27.360
Your Majesty!

22:27.940 --> 22:29.060
Why are you here?

22:29.420 --> 22:35.040
Our present company requested
that I show myself, even if briefly.

22:36.270 --> 22:39.540
I can roughly guess
what is going through your head.

22:40.780 --> 22:45.890
Sariphi, the fact is your anguishing
alone will not alter reality.

22:47.320 --> 22:51.840
But around this table seats
both demonkind and human.

22:52.460 --> 22:54.520
Don't forget
the awesome sacred beast, fool!

22:54.960 --> 22:57.480
There are those
who rejoiced at your return

22:57.480 --> 23:00.640
and wish to continue being
by your side.

23:01.180 --> 23:04.440
This too, is an irrefutable fact.

23:05.580 --> 23:09.820
That's right. How could I
have been so blind?

23:10.420 --> 23:17.700
Here lies a table where demonkind,
sacred beasts and humans are happy together.

23:18.380 --> 23:20.920
I pray that the whole world

23:21.340 --> 23:23.840
will one day
be like this little space.

23:26.320 --> 23:29.410
I'm back, Chancellor!
Sorry for worrying...

23:30.000 --> 23:31.580
What's wrong, Chancellor!?

23:31.720 --> 23:34.680
Chancellor? Hey, Chancellor!

23:35.400 --> 23:36.970
Lord Anubis is...

23:36.980 --> 23:39.980
(The Sea God and the Second Trial)
Dead...
